---
// Chip de disponibilidad: punto pulsante + etiqueta en mono
---

<span
  class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-paper-300 bg-paper-50 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-700 dark:border-ink-700 dark:bg-ink-900 dark:text-ink-200"
>
  <span class="relative flex size-2" aria-hidden="true">
    <span
      class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-emerald-500 opacity-60"
    ></span>
    <span class="relative inline-flex size-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
  </span>
  <slot />
</span>
